WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.870
Man, it's summer.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.040
It sure is.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.160
So what are we fishing for today?

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.000
Yeah, let's just call it a day today.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.660
Wait, why? We came all the way
to the club room in this heat.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.500
Let's at least fish something.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Go ahead and go fish for
some li'l horsies, or somethin'.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.700
What? But I'm sick of those.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.500
We did catch a lot of them.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.540
I love the feeling when you catch one,

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:35.080
but I wanted to know what
it feels like to fish for others.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:39.040
That feelin', eh? So you wanna
experience fish that'll pull even harder?

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:44.830
But not anything as intense as flatheads.
Maybe something a bit calmer...

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.790
Ya sure have a lot of requests.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.040
Then let's do some lure fishing
and catch some sea bass!

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.620
Sea bass are super fun!

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:55.000
Sea bass? Didn't Ohno-<i>senpai</i>
mention those before?

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.160
You cast like, "fwip,"
and reel them in like, "hngh!"

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:00.750
Then they latch on and put up
a real fight! It's so much fun!

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.660
Sorry. I have no idea what you just said.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.870
Sea bass are called "<i>suzuki</i>" in Japanese.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:12.160
It also changes its name from <i>seigo</i>,
to <i>fukko</i>, and then to <i>suzuki </i>as it grows.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:14.450
Big ones can span over one meter sometimes.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.080
O-One meter?!

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:19.160
Wait, no! I can't!
Those are bigger than flatheads!

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:22.040
Don't worry. It won't be like
you'd actually catch one that big.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.750
--No! That's scary!

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.700
--Boo. But it's so much fun.
--No! That's scary!

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.870
--Boo. But it's so much fun.

