"Smirk"

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:34.250
Now, then...

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:37.120
Let's go do some bobber
fishin' without any reels.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:40.200
You mean like with the rods we used
to catch the freshwater prawns?

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.700
Yeah, those.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.040
Fishing with bobbers without a reel...

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.410
I don't think I've done that before, either.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.330
