00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.040
--Horse mackerels.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:49.540
--Wait, horsies, then?
--Horse mackerels.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:52.160
--Wait, horsies, then?

