00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.250
Don't worry about us and have fun.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.660
It's pretty fun just watching, too.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:43.790
First, we're gonna throw in
plenty of chum to attract some fish.

