00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:45.540
They may be small, but they
gobble up hooks all the time.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:49.120
This specific wrasse is called a parajulis.

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:53.700
The green ones are male.
The red ones with black stripes are female.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:57.950
The blue ones may actually be a different
species called Thalassoma cupido.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.500
These have blue tummies
and they're really pretty.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:01.870
Wow...

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.750
