bigger fish don't gobble them up.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:08.910
Ah...

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:12.750
The hour before or after sunrise
and the sunset is called "<i>mazume</i>"

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:14.910
and that's when fish try to feed.

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:20.450
Larger fish come to feed on smaller fish
and come into this fishing harbor.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:24.870
Then, fishing after school
is actually pretty logical.

